{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"37385","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v51928","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"柾見ちえ","creatorId":"vndb:s23619","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:36839","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23619","name":"柾見ちえ","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:286510","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"間崎 俊介","creatorId":"vndb:s3014","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3014","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3014","name":"間崎 俊介","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:209204","source":"vndb"}],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c140392","characterName":"瀬良 不岐","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"162088","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"505375"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26370"],"vndbCharacterId":"c140392"},"originalCharacterName":"瀬良 不岐","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of this work. A sophomore at a local university, majoring in education. He lives in the house next door to Ui's, and his her childhood friend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has spent many years dealing with the shy Ui, who lacks self-confidence, and has developed a patient and caring personality. Because of this, he is often described as a good-natured person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has strong convictions that allows him to help others without worrying about public perceptions, and it is this kindness that has made both Ui and Seira like him. He is vulnerable to push and tears from girls."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c140392"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"地元の大学に通う大学二年生。教育学部。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛の隣の家に住む年上のお兄さん、幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分に自信のない内気な愛の相手を長年してきたので、辛抱強く、面倒見の性格になった。そのせいでお人好しと評されることも多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人目を気にせず人助けをできる芯の強さを持っていて、そういう優しさに、愛も星良も好きになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女の子からの押しと涙に弱い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26370","sourceWorkId":"36814","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"地元大学に通う二年生。教育学部。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛の隣の家に住む年上のお兄さんで、幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分に自身のない内気な愛の相手を長年してきたので、辛抱強く、面倒見の良い性格になった。そのせいでお人好しと評されることも多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人目を気にせず人助けを出来る芯の強さを持っていて、そういう優しさに、愛も星良も好きになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女の子からの押しと涙に弱い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"162088"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/72ca59479bf2f3a9e2d4a7b6acd52120b70fb2fc429fffff0d13311679baa787.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c2c8ff9bfe63fb4ac81442656719937d48bca270b954699b46f874c8bbaf356.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c140393","characterName":"加藤 愛","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"162086","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"505375"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26371"],"vndbCharacterId":"c140393"},"originalCharacterName":"加藤 愛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the heroines, a second-year student at a local school. A girl who is a childhood friend who lives in the house next door. She calls Fuki “big brother” and adores him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her name, “Ui”, has often been mistaken for “Ai” because of its unusual reading, and she has a little complex about it. She is a hard worker by nature and is good at working diligently."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since she and Fuki, who has been with her since birth, can communicate with each other with few words, her interactions with men are based on this."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a result, she has not mastered any of the male-female interactions necessary for romance. Since she is not naturally adept in matters of romance, she has a tendency to find it troublesome."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c140393"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のヒロイン"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"地元の学園に通う二年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不岐の隣の家に住む幼馴染の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不岐のことを「お兄」と呼んで慕っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"名前の「愛（うい）」が変わった読み方でよく間違えられてきたので、少しコンプレックスに思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生来の努力家で、地道に頑張るのが得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれた時から一緒の不岐とは言葉少なく通じ合える仲なので、男性との交流は、それが基準になってしまっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、恋愛に必要な男女の駆け引きが全く身に付いていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々、恋愛面で器用な性格ではないので、むしろ、そういった駆け引きを面倒に思ってしまっているところがある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26371","sourceWorkId":"36814","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のヒロイン"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"地元の学園に通う二年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不岐の隣の家に住む幼馴染の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不岐のことを「お兄」と呼んで慕っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"名前の「愛（うい）」が変わった読み方でよく間違えられてきたので、少しコンプレックスに思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生来の努力家で、地道に頑張るのが得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれた時から一緒の不岐とは言葉少なく通じ合える仲なので、男性との交流は、それが基準になってしまっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、恋愛に必要な男女の駆け引きが全く身に付いていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々、恋愛面で器用な性格ではないので、むしろ、そういった駆け引きを面倒に思ってしまっているところがある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"162086"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/be/be1cec301edbbf71c1e92f8ed1899ed8344e7ed2dcedbf553f500e7a4d9cefbe.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/65761de3b00d147b4334251fa972de6670ded33f12c15cab70a9ecb53ce5ae1a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朝比奈幸","creatorId":"vndb:s21648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21648","name":"朝比奈 幸","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:505375:162086:17080:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"綾音 まこ","creatorId":"vndb:s2581","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2581","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2581","name":"綾音 まこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98521","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c140394","characterName":"相川 星良","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"162087","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"505375"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26372"],"vndbCharacterId":"c140394"},"originalCharacterName":"相川 星良","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the heroines. She is a classmate attending the same university and the same department as Fuki. She is the girlfriend of Fuki."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a model-like face and style. She is confident as a woman and has worked hard, so she is proud. She is interested in fashion and beauty, and has further refined her attractiveness as a woman."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a cool personality that displays her quick wit and decisiveness. She is a bit brusque, which, combined with her beautiful face, gives people around her a cold impression of her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a sister who's much younger than her, and she cares for her deeply."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c140394"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のもう一人のヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不岐と同じ大学、同じ学部に通う、同級生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不岐の彼女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"モデルのような整った顔立ちとスタイルの持ち主で、女としての自分に自信を持っており、努力もしてきたので、プライドが高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お洒落や美容に関心が強い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"星良のそれは趣味の領域に達しており、女としての魅力を磨いてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭の回転の良さと割り切りの良さが目立つクールな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無愛想気味なので、整った顔立ちと相まって周囲に冷たい印象を与えてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年の離れた妹がいるため、実は面倒見が良い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26372","sourceWorkId":"36814","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のもう一人のヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不岐と同じ大学、同じ学部に通う同級生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不岐の彼女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"モデルような整った顔立ちとスタイルの持ち主で、女としての自分に自信を持っており、努力もしてきたので、プライドが高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お洒落や美容に関心が強い。星良のそれは趣味の領域に達しており、女としての魅力を磨いてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭の回転の良さと割り切りの良さが目立つクールな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不愛想気味なので、整った顔立ちと相まって周囲に冷たい印象を与えてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年の離れた妹がいるため、実は面倒見がよい。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"162087"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/85d9486cebffa211f0c72737078a297bf29c96dc3313a923522b68b5e6b550fc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/845a5a762efdb2b98d5899a46566c1ab3d32a76f6b07df05ad58460b98029950.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桐村まり","creatorId":"vndb:s1549","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1549","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1549","name":"桐村 まり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:505375:162087:23768:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c142472","characterName":"多賀 まひろ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c142472"},"originalCharacterName":"多賀 まひろ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ui's close friend and classmate. She is an athletic girl with a tanned skin and a track-and-field background."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a friendly and cheerful personality and has as many friends as Ui. She is also a manly and easy-going person, so she has more male friends than Ui. She is talked to openly by the male members of the club."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She takes good care of her friends, and is greatly admired by the younger members of the club. She is a kind and very reliable senior."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c142472"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f4bbcc0db2ce80f8ae8f1703e709724ddf1def880546f085f18590690a448a2d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/80/80bffbfffea78d946a828424ee18c1f826b7548751bd0f7f71a1489a46d97ed3.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"風花 ましろ","creatorId":"vndb:s5762","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5762","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5762","name":"中野 純花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98522","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c142473","characterName":"瀬良 夏美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c142473"},"originalCharacterName":"瀬良 夏美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fuki's mother. She is a happy housewife blessed with a kind husband and a gentle son."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has known the Katou family, her next-door neighbors, for 20 years, and is so close to Ui's mother, Koharu, that they sometimes go on trips together."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loves Ui as if she were her own daughter and hopes that her son will marry her if possible. She was surprised when his son brought Seira as his girlfriend, but he likes her very much because she is beautiful and polite."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c142473"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/83/83c7b6db65f2365069bf26a854db08cf2cf35e8ec2aad24b217045946f6f5e01.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/3961709da3a0f39d01175603a553fa5d34fabe00c5ced0f194510fdf1d2c2bcc.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"御苑生 メイ","creatorId":"vndb:s278","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s278","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s278","name":"小山 さほみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98518","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c142474","characterName":"加藤 小春","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c142474"},"originalCharacterName":"加藤 小春","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ui's mother. A happy housewife blessed with a kind husband and a lovely daughter and son."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She met the Sera family, her next-door neighbors, when they moved into their new house, and they hit it off because they are the same age. Since then, they have been good family friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has long been aware that her daughter Ui is in love with Fuki, and secretly supports her. However, he does not really believe that she is aware of him as a member of the opposite sex."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c142474"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/18/18ef5ccd44784dda19ec1603e74b5267f3abc0aaa20a84011336f06c615a1648.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/edcd11757a9ad6cf5640322f2612494588f916b4b98066a7a5ba06101cf884a0.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榛名 れん","creatorId":"vndb:s455","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s455","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s455","name":"神保 巴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98519","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p341","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:334","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p341","name":"Waffle","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:37385:334","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p341","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p341","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p341","name":"Waffle","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:136530:v51928","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p341","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p341","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p341","name":"Waffle","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:136664:v51928","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p341","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p341","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p341","name":"Waffle","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:139450:v51928","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":[],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
